      <title>New shelter part of broader homelessness strategy in Truckee–North Tahoe</title>
      <link>https://www.kunr.org/local-stories/2026-02-27/new-shelter-part-of-broader-homelessness-strategy-in-truckee-north-tahoe</link>
      <description>In the Truckee and North Tahoe region, local leaders are opening the area’s first year-round shelter for single adults experiencing homelessness, but they stress it’s only one part of a larger effort to reduce homelessness across the mountain community.</description>
